---
layout: layouts/archive-dark-base.njk
title: Scenario
listed: false
---

<article class="scenario-index">
  <header class="scenario-index__header">
    <h1>時系列</h1>
    <p>息子 篠原堅の記録。</p>
  </header>

  <section class="scenario-common-route" aria-labelledby="common-route-title">
    <header class="route-section-header">
      <h2 id="common-route-title">生い立ち</h2>
      <p>
       同じ孤独を抱えた二人の特殊能力者と絆を結ぶまで。
      </p>
    </header>

  <ol class="scenario-list">
    {% for scenario in collections.scenarios %}
      {% if scenario.data.timeline and scenario.data.timeline.route_type == "common" %}
        <li class="scenario-list-item">
          <a class="scenario-list-item__link" href="{{ scenario.url }}">
            <span class="scenario-list-item__phase">
              {{ scenario.data.timeline.phase }}
            </span>

            <span class="scenario-list-item__title">
              {{ scenario.data.title }}
            </span>

            {% if scenario.data.timeline.summary %}
              <span class="scenario-list-item__summary">
                {{ scenario.data.timeline.summary }}
              </span>
            {% endif %}
          </a>
        </li>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="scenario-branch-route" aria-labelledby="branch-route-title">
    <header class="route-section-header">
      <h2 id="branch-route-title">分岐</h2>
      <p>
        条件により変質した篠原堅の運命。
      </p>
    </header>

    <nav class="route-filter" aria-label="worldline filter">
      <button type="button" data-route-filter="fang" aria-pressed="true">FANG</button>
      <button type="button" data-route-filter="skin">SKIN</button>
      <button type="button" data-route-filter="presence">PRESENCE</button>
    </nav>

    <div class="route-description" aria-live="polite">
      <p data-route-description="fang">
        戸次信長との別離の末、本田千和と結ばれて自分の人生を取り戻す。
      </p>

      <p data-route-description="skin" hidden>
        精神支配能力者の被害を受けた末、人間性を失う。
      </p>

      <p data-route-description="presence" hidden>
        精神支配能力者の被害を受けた末、重い病に沈む。
      </p>
    </div>

    <ol class="scenario-list">
    {% for scenario in collections.scenarios %}
      {% if scenario.data.timeline and scenario.data.timeline.route_type == "branch" %}
        <li
          class="scenario-list-item"
          data-routes="{% if scenario.data.timeline.routes %}{{ scenario.data.timeline.routes | join(' ') }}{% endif %}"
        >
          <a class="scenario-list-item__link" href="{{ scenario.url }}">
            <span class="scenario-list-item__phase">
              {{ scenario.data.timeline.phase }}
            </span>

            <span class="scenario-list-item__title">
              {{ scenario.data.title }}
            </span>

            {% if scenario.data.timeline.summary %}
              <span class="scenario-list-item__summary">
                {{ scenario.data.timeline.summary }}
              </span>
            {% endif %}
          </a>
        </li>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
  </section>

    <section class="scenario-convergence-route" aria-labelledby="convergence-route-title">
    <header class="route-section-header">
      <h2 id="convergence-route-title">収束</h2>
      <p>
        どう行動しようと　変わらない結果。
      </p>
    </header>

    <ol class="scenario-list">
      {% for scenario in collections.scenarios %}
        {% if scenario.data.timeline and scenario.data.timeline.route_type == "convergence" %}
          <li class="scenario-list-item">
            <a class="scenario-list-item__link" href="{{ scenario.url }}">
              <span class="scenario-list-item__phase">
                {{ scenario.data.timeline.phase }}
              </span>

              <span class="scenario-list-item__title">
                {{ scenario.data.title }}
              </span>

              {% if scenario.data.timeline.summary %}
                <span class="scenario-list-item__summary">
                  {{ scenario.data.timeline.summary }}
                </span>
              {% endif %}
            </a>
          </li>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
  </section>
</article>